A||||6||Fiasco||Hypertech chip...||||5||
Z||000000||Fiasco||05-11-2000||03:22 PM||||Wondering if anyone has installed the Hypertech 'Street' chip- Is it as safe and problem free as advertised? I know you need to keep the engine properly tuned and run Premium and all, but that's kind of a given.<BR>And do you notice a big difference in performance?  Gas mileage???<BR>Thanks.||||reg||5
Z||000001||costly86gt||05-11-2000||06:38 PM||||The switch itself is the easy part.I also installed the fan switch and the thermostat.The fan switch was a pain to put in.Gas is expensive and you will notice a problem if 93 or better isn't used.As far as power it gives a little more kick at the start.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fiasco||05-11-2000||06:49 PM||||thanks.||||reg||1
Z||000003||fierosound||05-11-2000||08:46 PM||||I put a Hypertech Stage II chip in with the 160 thermostat and fan switch.  I also put in a K&N air filter.  I noticed a BIG difference in WOT as soon as I tried it on the road.  Idle speed, etc. is all normal.  It's been in the car ever since.<P>At the time (1990) the only other chips was by ADS, but I heard they were problematic (at least for Camaros).  These days there are more chips available.  Choices include: Hypertech, ADS, FASTchip, SuperChip, JetChip and more...<P>Jump over to the forum below where this was discussed at length.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/001709.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum2/HTML/001709.html</A> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 05-11-2000).]||||reg||14
Z||000004||88formula||05-11-2000||09:11 PM||||Running your motor at 160 degrees all the time will cause yout motor to sludge up.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Fiasco||05-11-2000||11:52 PM||||For real???<BR>Sounds odd... use thinner oil then.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Fiasco||05-12-2000||06:17 PM||||Well, I gambled and put in a Hypertech chip.<BR>It definitely isn't a drastic difference, but it's there. It's there when you floor it, for sure, and it seems to have kinda smoothed out the power curve. -Or widened the power band- same dif.<BR>I guess it was just about worth the $100.||||reg||1
